## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
Severity: MEDIUM  
AMAT is highly dependent on semiconductor foundries (e.g., TSMC, Samsung), which face cyclical CapEx spending. Its revenue concentration in data center customers (e.g., AI chipmakers) exposes it to macroeconomic downturns. While its diversified product portfolio provides some resilience, the industry's cyclicality remains a significant risk.  

